00:10:34.771 --> 00:10:35.371
PONY UP.

00:10:35.372 --> 00:10:37.473
&gt;&gt; Greg: THAT IS A SALESMAN.

00:10:41.111 --> 00:10:41.811
ALLOWED TO HAVE ACTIVISTS.

00:10:41.812 --> 00:10:43.913
IF THEY ARE NEUTRAL -- IF THEY

00:10:43.914 --> 00:10:45.514
ARE NEUTRAL, THEY ARE NOT

00:10:45.515 --> 00:10:46.315
ALLOWED TO PLAY.

00:10:46.316 --> 00:10:48.784
THAT IS LIKE DEALING YOURSELF AT

00:10:48.785 --> 00:10:49.752
A BLACKJACK TABLE WITHOUT ANY

00:10:51.655 --> 00:10:53.289
IF YOU ARE NEUTRAL, YOU CAN'T

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.292
PROTEST, HOW ABOUT THAT?

00:10:58.562 --> 00:11:00.529
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DON'T KNOW.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.531
I DON'T READ A LOT.

00:11:02.532 --> 00:11:03.566
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SWITZERLAND OR

00:11:03.567 --> 00:11:04.100
SWEDEN?

00:11:04.101 --> 00:11:05.968
&gt;&gt; Greg: I GET THEM CONFUSED.

00:11:05.969 --> 00:11:14.176
ONE OF THEM YODEL.

00:11:14.177 --> 00:11:19.249
THE SWEDES FISH.

